# Canonical reviewed solution: directly authored binary, not assembler output.
11111010 # instruction | CLI | Keep the final halt stopped.
10111011 00000000 00000000 # instruction | MOV BX,0 | Initialize BX independently of the BIOS loader.
10111001 00000000 00000000 # instruction | MOV CX,0 | Initialize CX so it must remain zero.
10111011 00101010 00000000 # instruction | MOV BX,42 | BB equals B8 plus register index three, selecting BX.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Stop with BX=42 and CX=0.
